67
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:30,919
(Does Duan Xiuming know something?)

68
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:33,599
(If he knows I'm using him,)

69
00:03:33,919 --> 00:03:34,759
(what do I do?)

70
00:03:35,879 --> 00:03:37,599
(Calm down. Think.)

71
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:39,800
(There must be a way.)

72
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,039
(No.)

73
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,479
(This is unsolvable.)

74
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,319
(In the face of absolute sincerity,)

75
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:54,199
(all carefully designed schemes)

76
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:56,520
(are doomed to fail.)

77
00:04:03,223 --> 00:04:04,263
(Passport)

78
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:23,639
Lu Mingyu, tell me the truth.

79
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,839
You never planned

80
00:04:25,839 --> 00:04:27,360
to marry me in Xiangjiang, right?

81
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,560
You planned to leave from the start,

82
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:30,439
right?

83
00:04:32,959 --> 00:04:33,639
Yes.

84
00:04:35,199 --> 00:04:36,000
Good.

85
00:04:40,879 --> 00:04:42,319
So all this time, in your eyes,

86
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:44,279
I was just a disposable tool, right?

87
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,639
Answer me, Lu Mingyu!

88
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:55,000
I'm sorry, Duan Xiuming.

89
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,360
Tell me.

90
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,839
When did you decide

91
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:11,759
to start using me?

92
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,879
When we met again at the lounge.

93
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,480
Still single?

94
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,519
Of course.

95
00:05:17,879 --> 00:05:18,839
Let's do it again.

96
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,839
Tonight, you never met me.

97
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,399
And you didn't drive me back either.

98
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,839
Rest easy and go home, good girl.

99
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,079
I will handle

100
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,319
everything else.

101
00:05:26,839 --> 00:05:28,000
No hitting in my family.

102
00:05:28,279 --> 00:05:29,959
No one touches my woman.

103
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,079
Not even me.

104
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:33,399
Then... Come propose.

105
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,040
Kiss me.

106
00:05:38,496 --> 00:05:40,863
♪I'll say what I have to say♪

107
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,839
(Crash into it.)

108
00:05:46,023 --> 00:05:48,323
♪You better get out of my way♪

109
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:50,000
(Force the guys inside out.)

110
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,600
(Make a big scene.)

111
00:05:55,076 --> 00:05:58,716
♪I'm fighting for survival♪

112
00:05:58,976 --> 00:06:01,909
♪I'm winning every day♪

113
00:06:02,959 --> 00:06:04,319
You get things done.

114
00:06:05,199 --> 00:06:07,079
You were my only way
out of the Lu family.

115
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:10,759
And after that?

116
00:06:11,839 --> 00:06:12,959
You kept using me.

117
00:06:14,399 --> 00:06:16,120
Keeping me from having you
was part of your scheme too.

118
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:18,360
A whole month,

119
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,759
you lured me step by step.

120
00:06:21,959 --> 00:06:22,879
You're really good at this.

121
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:26,240
Delayed gratification.

122
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,319
To get you hooked.

123
00:06:29,839 --> 00:06:31,600
What delayed gratification.

124
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,800
Truly amazing tactics.

125
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:37,639
So why are you now

126
00:06:37,639 --> 00:06:39,399
able to sit here so calmly,

127
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:41,040
answering my questions?

128
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:44,399
Because this knife isn't sharp enough?

129
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,079
Do I have no use for you anymore?

130
00:06:54,636 --> 00:06:57,356
(Tao Yalan)

131
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,800
I don't need you anymore.

132
00:07:14,759 --> 00:07:15,560
Not anymore?

133
00:07:16,639 --> 00:07:17,920
Sweet words,

134
00:07:19,319 --> 00:07:20,360
ruthless deeds,

135
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,160
using my heart as a bridge.

136
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,360
What a move.

137
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:29,720
Come on.

138
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,600
Show me your winner's pose.

139
00:07:36,079 --> 00:07:37,360
I'm not in the mood.

140
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,360
I accept that you used me.

141
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:51,319
Even if you hadn't told me,

142
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:52,240
I'd still crash the wedding.

143
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,480
I deserved it.

144
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,519
But now, I only have one question.

145
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,680
Have you ever,

146
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:08,279
even just a little bit,

147
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:11,079
truly liked me?

148
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,480
Not scheming, not using.

149
00:08:18,399 --> 00:08:19,079
Just...

150
00:08:20,639 --> 00:08:21,800
truly liked me?

151
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:33,799
I'm sorry.

152
00:08:33,836 --> 00:08:40,143
♪You're all my joy, my every heartbeat♪

153
00:08:41,316 --> 00:08:46,956
♪I want to grow old with you♪

154
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:48,879
Lu Mingyu.

155
00:08:49,679 --> 00:08:51,440
Would it kill you to love me a little?

156
00:08:52,936 --> 00:08:55,796
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

157
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,360
But I'm really

158
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,480
too tired to love.

159
00:09:03,150 --> 00:09:09,023
♪You're all my joy, all my pride♪

160
00:09:11,083 --> 00:09:16,996
♪Even the ordinary can shine so bright♪

161
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,360
I'll get you pregnant,

162
00:09:22,519 --> 00:09:24,200
so you'll stay by my side forever.

163
00:09:24,519 --> 00:09:25,600
You're not going anywhere.

164
00:09:25,850 --> 00:09:31,614
♪Every day is a gentle embrace♪

165
00:09:31,639 --> 00:09:33,679
Duan Xiuming, don't do this.

166
00:09:33,696 --> 00:09:39,349
♪I love the smile in your eyes♪

167
00:09:40,543 --> 00:09:46,209
♪Like stars falling into my arms♪

168
00:09:48,039 --> 00:09:49,279
I've really gone crazy.

169
00:09:51,650 --> 00:09:55,116
♪We could roam the world so wide♪

170
00:09:55,790 --> 00:10:01,456
♪With you, anywhere feels right♪

171
00:10:02,663 --> 00:10:09,643
♪You took my hand, said don't be scared♪

172
00:10:10,150 --> 00:10:11,929
♪With you, no place is far♪

173
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,120
I'm sorry.

174
00:10:17,356 --> 00:10:24,336
♪Now I know what longing is♪

175
00:10:24,863 --> 00:10:31,089
♪From dawn to starlight with you♪

176
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,039
Go on, tell me.

177
00:10:36,639 --> 00:10:37,879
Why did you sleep with me back then?

178
00:10:40,559 --> 00:10:41,360
I wanted to pick

179
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:43,559
who I'd lose my virginity to.

180
00:10:44,919 --> 00:10:45,679
Okay.

181
00:10:46,399 --> 00:10:47,240
Good choice.

182
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,559
You're really good at it.

183
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:56,240
What happens to those who mess with you?

184
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,000
They die.

185
00:10:58,759 --> 00:10:59,480
That's fine.

186
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:03,080
Better to die by your hand

187
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,559
than stay in the Lu family.

188
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,879
That's others' fate.

189
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,399
Not including you.

190
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,639
In love, I lost.

191
00:11:18,559 --> 00:11:19,679
No one to blame.

192
00:11:28,799 --> 00:11:30,240
What's your next move?

193
00:11:35,279 --> 00:11:35,960
Going abroad.

194
00:11:37,639 --> 00:11:38,480
Leaving tonight.

195
00:11:46,256 --> 00:11:48,169
(Global Airlines XIZ-LHR)

196
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,240
Unbelievable.

197
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:51,960
Flying that far.

198
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,039
Buying such a cheap red-eye flight.

199
00:11:55,919 --> 00:11:57,200
Can your small frame handle it?

200
00:12:09,519 --> 00:12:10,200
Take it.

201
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:11,720
I don't want it.

202
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,840
You've helped me enough.

203
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,399
Take it. I have my pride.

204
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:25,639
Wait for me.

205
00:12:45,569 --> 00:12:49,236
♪Wherever you go♪

206
00:12:50,063 --> 00:12:51,603
♪Oh, you♪

207
00:12:52,350 --> 00:12:54,015
♪Wherever you are♪

208
00:12:54,039 --> 00:12:55,399
(That anonymous buyer)

209
00:12:56,039 --> 00:12:57,159
(was him?)

210
00:12:59,156 --> 00:13:00,869
♪Wherever you go♪

211
00:13:27,263 --> 00:13:31,856
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

212
00:13:34,443 --> 00:13:38,396
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

213
00:13:41,423 --> 00:13:45,903
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

214
00:13:47,236 --> 00:13:52,083
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

215
00:13:54,570 --> 00:14:01,123
♪A love letter written in song♪

216
00:14:01,423 --> 00:14:06,383
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

217
00:14:08,740 --> 00:14:14,886
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

218
00:14:15,412 --> 00:14:21,378
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

219
00:14:21,941 --> 00:14:28,937
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

220
00:14:29,697 --> 00:14:31,856
♪Close your eyes and count♪

221
00:14:32,147 --> 00:14:34,761
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

222
00:14:34,773 --> 00:14:41,258
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
